# GitHub Linguist Configuration
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# 1. Mark third-party / agentic engine code as vendored so it is excluded from language statistics
agentic/** linguist-vendored
agentic/** linguist-detectable=false
rag/** linguist-vendored

# 2. Mark database scripts and plan docs
database/** linguist-documentation
plan/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation

# 3. Highlight core project languages
backend/** linguist-detectable=true
frontend/** linguist-detectable=true
